\"一、機率思維在擋什麼\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-2\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-2\",\"children\":\"二、三個能寫下來的觀念\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-3\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-3\",\"children\":\"三、為什麼口號沒用\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-4\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-4\",\"children\":\"四、和確認偏誤、損失趨避的關係\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-5\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-5\",\"children\":\"五、最小動作\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-6\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-6\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-7\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-7\",\"children\":\"總結\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"sec-8\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#sec-8\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_body__6B7Mb\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_intro__ATV5c\",\"children\":\"馬克·道格拉斯的公開寫作被很多交易者當成心理課本。核心不是叫你放鬆，是叫你接受：下一筆的輸贏無法預知，你能管的是規則與樣本。人一想證明自己是對的，就會刪掉離開條件、加大部位、只看支持自己的證據。心理課本若只剩「保持平常心」，會變成另一句做不到的口號。\"}],[],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldr__Br5BY\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"b\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrTitle__K5PBN\",\"children\":\"本文重點\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tldrList__VSc2_\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"下一筆無法預知，不表示方法沒有期望值\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"想證明自己對，是多數壞決策的共同起點\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"平常心要靠規則與小部位，不能靠提醒自己平常心\"}]]}]]}],[[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-1\",{\"id\":\"sec-1\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"一、機率思維在擋什麼\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"公開文本把交易比成已知優勢的遊戲：單次結果隨機，多次之後才看得出方法。擋的是「這筆一定要對」。一定要對，就會在虧的時候找理由，在賺的時候提早離開以免被證明錯。兩邊都是在保護自我，不是在執行規則。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"單次隨機\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"多次才看得出方法\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"一定要對會破壞兩邊\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-2\",{\"id\":\"sec-2\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"二、三個能寫下來的觀念\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"第一，任何一筆都可以輸，包括你最有把握的。第二，輸了只是樣本的一點，不是人格判決。第三，沒有足夠樣本，你沒有資格說方法好或壞。第三個和「樣本數太少」那題是同一件事。\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"感覺\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"機率翻譯\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"規則該怎麼寫\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"這筆不會錯\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"仍可能錯\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"一樣要有作廢\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"輸了代表我不行\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"一個樣本\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"繼續照做或停下來檢討流程\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"連贏所以加大\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"序列會騙你\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"部位仍跟規則\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"連輸所以改方法\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"可能只是變異\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"先看樣本夠不夠\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-3\",{\"id\":\"sec-3\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"三、為什麼口號沒用\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"「不要恐懼」沒有檢查點。小部位、事前作廢、固定檢討時間，才有檢查點。道格拉斯被讀成心靈雞湯時，最常少掉的就是這些笨工具。\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listNum__86N5S\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"把部位小到痛得過\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"把作廢寫在進場前\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"把檢討排進行程\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\",\"children\":\"!這筆一定要對!連贏就加大!連輸就改方法\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\",\"children\":\"自我上場時\"}]]}]]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-4\",{\"id\":\"sec-4\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[\"$L18\",[\"$L19\",\"$L1a\"]]}],\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\"],\"$L1f\"]}]]}]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"四、和確認偏誤、損失趨避的關係\"}]\n19:[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"想證明自己對，會啟動確認偏誤；不肯做實虧損，是損失趨避。心理課本其實是在給這兩種偏誤一個名字：自我。名字不重要，工具重要。\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_listCheck__xx1CF\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"自我要證明\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"規則不必證明\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"選規則\"}]]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-5\",{\"id\":\"sec-5\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"五、最小動作\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"下一筆寫上：這筆可以輸。寫完若你就不想做了，說明你要的其實是證明，不是樣本。\"}]]]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-6\",{\"id\":\"sec-6\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"接受隨機是不是就不要分析？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"分析用來形成有規則的優勢假設。接受隨機是承認單次仍可輸。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"連輸時還要繼續嗎？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"先看是規則內的變異，還是規則已失效。失效判斷見策略失效那篇。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"很有把握的筆能不能加大？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"把握不是機率證明。加大必須事先寫在規則裡，不能現場投票。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"和期望值怎麼一起看？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"期望值是方法的長期數學。心理是你肯不肯把數學做滿一個樣本。\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-7\",{\"id\":\"sec-7\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"總結\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"道格拉斯要的是機率思維：單次可輸、輸不是人格、樣本不夠就別下結論。平常心靠規則與小部位，不靠口號。\"}]]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-8\",{\"id\":\"sec-8\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-期望值怎麼算\",{\"href\":\"/learn/what-is-expectancy-in-trading\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"期望值怎麼算\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-確認偏誤\",{\"href\":\"/learn/confirmation-bias-in-trading-decisions\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"確認偏誤\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-策略失效怎麼判斷\",{\"href\":\"/learn/how-to-tell-if-a-strategy-is-broken\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"策略失效怎麼判斷\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"Lear